 "notes": "Shore dive from the concrete steps and platform below the Karpata landhuis: elkhorn shallows at 3-8 m, a steep drop-off close in with buttresses and sand channels to about 45 m, the mooring at about 6 m and the old coral-covered anchor at about 11 m (bonaire.com and infobonaire.com site descriptions; more anchors lie in the shallows but their positions are not published). The anchor's exact spot beside the mooring and the route direction are assumptions. Coastline and dive-site markers © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Positions are approximate.",
